{"id":"cigarrillo","lemma":"cigarrillo","pos":"noun","rank":1912,"glosses":["cigarette"],"ipa":"/θiɡaˈriʝo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cigarrillos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cigarrillo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom prendió un cigarrillo.","en":"Tom lit a cigarette.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799142"},{"text":"Ella fuma veinte cigarrillos al día.","en":"She smokes 20 cigarettes a day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707130"},{"text":"Tomás encendió un cigarrillo.","en":"Tom lit a cigarette.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455262"},{"text":"¿Qué marca de cigarrillos fuma usted?","en":"What brand of cigarettes do you smoke?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689540"},{"text":"Me moría por un cigarrillo.","en":"I was aching for a cigarette.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1253519"}]}